---
import { GITHUB } from '../lib/release'
---
<section class="story" id="why">
  <div class="wrap story-in">
    <span class="eyebrow"><i class="dot"></i> A note from the maker</span>
    <h2>Why a screenshot app <span class="serif">in 2026?</span></h2>
    <div class="story-body">
      <p>Taking screenshots is something I do a lot, and I suspect I'm not the only one.</p>
      <p>
        There are plenty of screenshot tools out there, and some are arguably more polished. I'd probably have stuck
        with <a class="ref" href="https://app.prntscr.com/en/index.html"><img src="/lightshot.png" alt="" width="16" height="16" />Lightshot</a> if it didn't look set to have compatibility problems with upcoming macOS versions. So I built one that
        fits my own workflow and comes with the extra tools I need.
      </p>
      <p>
        The aim: good defaults that cover most people's everyday needs (hopefully), while staying very customizable and
        extensible.
      </p>
      <p class="story-last">
        And it's all <a href={GITHUB}>open source</a>. If it still isn't quite right for you, fork it and ask Claude or
        ChatGPT to build the version you need.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story { background: var(--bg-soft); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .story-in { max-width: 720px; display: grid; gap: 22px; }
  .story-body { display: grid; gap: 18px; font-size: clamp(17px, 2.1vw, 20px); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-2); letter-spacing: -.005em; }
  .story-body p:first-child { font-size: 1.15em; color: var(--fg); font-weight: 500; }
  .story-last { padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line-strong); }
  .story-last a { color: var(--fg); text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 60%, transparent); text-underline-offset: 3px; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  /* Lightshot's own purple, with its feather icon */
  .ref {
    --ls: #7b4fd6;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 0 9px 0 6px; border-radius: 8px; line-height: 1.5; vertical-align: baseline;
    text-decoration: none; font-weight: 550; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ls) 85%, var(--fg));
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ls) 12%, var(--card)); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ls) 28%, transparent);
    transition: background .15s;
  }
  .ref:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ls) 20%, var(--card)); }
  .ref img { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
</style>
